//@version=6
// Quiver Congress & Insider Signals
// Data: Quiver Quant, generated 2026-10-20 (216 tickers, 308 trades) by bots/tradingview-signals.
// Pine Script can't fetch outside data, so the trades are embedded below. Regenerate the
// script to refresh them instead of editing the data block by hand.
// Chart markers and alerts only: this script never places orders.
indicator("Quiver Congress & Insider Signals", shorttitle = "Quiver", overlay = true, max_labels_count = 500)

const string AS_OF = "2026-10-20"

bool showCongress = input.bool(true, "Congress trades", group = "Show")
bool showInsider = input.bool(true, "Insider trades (SEC Form 4)", group = "Show")
bool showSells = input.bool(true, "Sells", group = "Show")
bool showTable = input.bool(true, "Info panel", group = "Show")
int clusterDays = input.int(30, "Cluster window (days)", minval = 1, group = "Signals",
     tooltip = "A buy is a cluster buy when Congress and insiders both bought this stock within this many days.")

// Records are date|side|source|who|detail, oldest first. side: B/S. source: C = Congress, I = insider.
